    "created_at": "2020-12-04T03:39:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-04T03:39:54Z",
    "body": "It seems a little inconsistent that it is only throwing the error on main then. If table layout is abused for all elements except main it validates perfectly. I'd expect it to be all or nothing. Example:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<table>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><header></header></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n                    <td><nav></nav></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<main></main>\r\n<table>\r\n\t    <tr>\r\n                    <td><aside></aside></td>\r\n                    <td><footer></footer></td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
